  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study on Indonesian offshore wind and floating solar sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study investigated how (offshore) wind and floating solar energy, as well as the related infrastructure (grid system, ports etc), can take a leap in Indonesia in the coming 5 to 10 years, and how the Netherlands can further position itself as key partner in government, knowledge and business support.</narrative>
  </description>
